{{!
    @template enrol_semco/healthcheckautofixconfirm

    SEMCO health check automatic fix confirmation template.

    This template is rendered on the server and handed over to the Moodle core confirmation modal as its body.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * title - The title of the health check item which is going to be fixed
    * findings - The list of findings which are going to be fixed, each with a 'finding' key
    * hasmultiplefindings - Whether there is more than one finding
    * singlefinding - The one and only finding, if there is exactly one
    * note - The note which explains that the automatic fix does not repair the plugin installation, if this is the case
    * isrisky - Whether the automatic fix is not entirely harmless

    Example context (json):
    {
        "title": "Moodle messaging system",
        "findings": [ { "finding": "The Moodle messaging system is enabled." } ],
        "hasmultiplefindings": false,
        "singlefinding": "The Moodle messaging system is enabled.",
        "note": "Please note: This finding is not a fault of the SEMCO plugin or of its installation.",
        "isrisky": true
    }
}}
<div class="enrol_semco-healthcheckautofix-modal">
    <p><strong>{{#str}}healthcheckautofixconfirmcheck, enrol_semco{{/str}}</strong><br />
    {{title}}</p>
    {{! The findings are HTML as they may contain lists, thus they are output unescaped. A list must not be wrapped in
        a paragraph, thus the single finding gets a div. }}
    {{#singlefinding}}
        <p class="mb-0"><strong>{{#str}}healthcheckautofixconfirmfinding, enrol_semco{{/str}}</strong></p>
        <div class="mb-3">{{{singlefinding}}}</div>
    {{/singlefinding}}
    {{#hasmultiplefindings}}
        <p class="mb-0"><strong>{{#str}}healthcheckautofixconfirmfindings, enrol_semco{{/str}}</strong></p>
        <ul class="enrol_semco-healthcheckautofix-findings">
            {{#findings}}
                <li>{{{finding}}}</li>
            {{/findings}}
        </ul>
    {{/hasmultiplefindings}}
    {{#note}}
        <p class="enrol_semco-healthcheckautofix-note">{{note}}</p>
    {{/note}}
    {{#isrisky}}
        <div class="alert alert-danger enrol_semco-healthcheckautofix-risky" role="alert">
            {{#str}}healthcheckautofixconfirmrisky, enrol_semco{{/str}}
        </div>
    {{/isrisky}}
    <p class="mb-0">{{#str}}healthcheckautofixconfirmquestion, enrol_semco{{/str}}</p>
</div>
